Tudat
Copyright 2010-2013 Delft University of Technology

This product includes software developed in the Astrodynamics and Space missions
research chair at the Faculty of Aerospace Engineering, Delft University of 
Technology, The Netherlands. Most of this software was developed in conjunction 
with graduate student research.

More information on the Tudat project can be found at http://tudat.tudelft.nl.
The Tudat Wiki (http://tudat.tudelft.nl/projects/tudat/wiki) contains extensive
documentation, howtos, and tutorials.

This software makes use of the Eigen (http://eigen.tuxfamily.org/) and Boost C++ 
(http://www.boost.org/).

For any enquires, please contact tudat-AE@tudelft.nl.

The IERS 2010 solid Earth gravity tide frequency tables are transcribed from
Orekit 13.1.8 resource data (Copyright 2002-2025 CS GROUP), licensed under
Apache License 2.0. The original license and notices are retained in
third_parties/orekit-data/. See the solid-gravity reference fixture README for
source hashes, extraction and the primary IERS table cross-check.
